  <Intro>k__BackingField: The king and the coven have made peace with each other, which shows how afraid they are. Harald Axe rides at your side. One horde, one war, and then the clans never kneel again.
  <Outro>k__BackingField: The horde rides home with the crown of the realm on a spear. Grom hangs it in his hall, where the children can look at it.
